Hi

Thank you for your reply.
The bridge works well.

I added

brctl addif pan0 $1
ifconfig $1 0.0.0.0

to the /etc/bluetooth/pan/dev-up

and do some initialization about the bridge

brctl addbr pan0
ifconfig pan0 10.0.0.1 up
brctl setfd pan0 0
brctl stp pan0 off


